{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Glowstone Ring is a ",["l","戒指","ring"]," that can be ",["l","打造","crafted"]," after earning the recipe at ",["f","Mining_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","采矿","Mining"]," Level 4. It can also be purchased at the ",["l","星露谷展览会","Stardew Valley Fair"]," for 1,000 Prize Tickets, although it's not guaranteed to be in stock. It can also be found in ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"],"es."]],["p",["Wearing it combines the lighting and ",["l","磁性","magnetism"]," effects of one ",["l","光辉戒指","Glow Ring"]," and one ",["l","磁铁戒指","Magnet Ring"],". Its effects stack with another Glowstone Ring, an ",["l","铱环","Iridium Band"],", a ",["l","光辉戒指","Glow Ring"],", a ",["l","磁铁戒指","Magnet Ring"],", a ",["l","小型光辉戒指","Small Glow Ring"],", or a ",["l","小型磁铁戒指","Small Magnet Ring"],"."]]]],["Dyeing",2,[["p",["The Glowstone Ring can be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as a yellow dye at the dye pots located in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],"."]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": Introduced."]]]]]]]}